只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Durable-agent engine for DeepSeek Harness: host-plane cordis service mounting @earendil-works/pi-durable (conversations, exactly-once submits) + model-facing durable_agent_* tools.","id":"gh:1402755429","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-pi-durable","slug":"hy-sde/dsh-pi-durable","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Durable-agent engine for DeepSeek Harness: host-plane cordis service mounting @earendil-works/pi-dur"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"able (conversations, exactly-once submits) + model-facing durable_agent_* tools."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> 📦 This plugin lives in the **dsh-plugins** monorepo — file issues & pull requests there."},{"id":"p2s2","text":"\n> npm: `@hy-sde-org/dsh-pi-durable` · `@hy-sde-org/dsh-tool-pi-durable`"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# dsh-pi-durable — a durable agent conversation for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Durable-agent capability for [DeepSeek\nHarness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness), de"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"livered as two\nstandalone `@hy-sde-org` packages (**no harness source changes**): a\n**separate conve"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rsation** the model can drive — its own transcript, its own\ncoding toolset (bash/read/write/edit via"},{"id":"p4s4","text":" `CodingTools` +\n`NodeExecutionEnv`), its own durable SQLite storage, and its own model route\n(the c"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"`NodeExecutionEnv`), its own durable SQLite storage, and its own model route\n(the configured relay)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Identity | Value |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Package (engine) | `@hy-sde-org/dsh-pi-durable` — HOST plane; publishes the `piDurableAgent` servi"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ce: a pi-durable `Harness` over `~/.dsh/storages/pi-agent.sqlite` with an OpenAI-compatible relay pr"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ovider (`@earendil-works/pi-durable` + `@earendil-works/pi-ai`) |\n| Package (tools) | `@hy-sde-org/d"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"sh-tool-pi-durable` — preset row; the model-facing tools (`durable_agent_submit`, `durable_agent_wri"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"te`, `durable_agent_status`, `durable_agent_history`, `durable_agent_fork`, `durable_agent_abort`) +"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" the `durable-agent` prompt section; resolves the engine service by name |\n| Plugin row ids | `hy-sd"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"e-pi-durable`, `hy-sde-tool-pi-durable` (the `hy-sde-` prefix avoids clashing with any shipped row —"},{"id":"p6s8","text":" a duplicate loader id fails the boot) |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **Based on pi by franekp (MIT)** — the\n> durable-agent harness is mounted as the unmodified npm pa"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ckages\n> `@earendil-works/pi-durable` (conversations, exactly-once submissions,\n> fork-at-entry, tas"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ks, documents over a SQLite storage backend),\n> `@earendil-works/pi-ai` (the model layer: `createPro"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"vider`,\n> OpenAI-compatible API handlers), and `@earendil-works/chord` (structured\n> concurrency con"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"texts). No source from pi is vendored into this repository —\n> the adaptation to DeepSeek Harness is"},{"id":"p7s6","text":" exactly the two cordis rows (the cordis\n> plugin contract and model-facing tool registration), with"},{"id":"p7s7","text":" **no harness\n> source changes**. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"A background run outlives the host that started it: the durable agent keeps\nits own transcript in it"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"s own durable SQLite storage, every commit is\ncheckpointed, and the process can crash and resume — a"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" host restart neither\nloses the conversation nor forgets how far one run got. Submissions are\nexactl"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"y-once per `requestId`, so a retry after a crash cannot double-run a\ntask, and conversations fork at"},{"id":"p9s5","text":" any entry (transcript inherited up to the\nfork point), so a divergent branch can be retried without"},{"id":"p9s6","text":" replaying history.\nWhere the rest of the orchestration plane tracks *who promised what and who\nneed"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"s waking*, pi-durable tracks *how far one conversation got*: per-step\ncheckpoints, fork-at-entry, du"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"rable documents/tasks."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Prerequisites"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0` with npm and pnpm on `PATH`;\n- a DeepSeek Harness release carrying "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"the `0.2.0-rc.2` peer range —\n`@deepseek-ai/cordis ~4.0.4` and `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools ^0.2.0-rc.2` "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"—\nincluding the standard `dsh` CLI;\n- for generation: an OpenAI-compatible relay endpoint (`baseUrl`"},{"id":"p11s4","text":") and the\nenvironment variable named by `apiKeyEnv` (default `PI_DURABLE_API_KEY`).\nWithout `baseUrl"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"` the engine still installs and runs in **write-only mode**;\n- nothing else — the engine owns its ow"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"l installs and runs in **write-only mode**;\n- nothing else — the engine owns its own storage medium."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Install the Harness CLI and pnpm before continuing:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Route A — published npm packages (recommended)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Route B — from source (validate this checkout or hack on the plugin)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"`pnpm pack` runs the normal `prepack` build and produces tarballs containing\n`dist/`. A direct `gith"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ub:<this-repo>` dependency does not contain built output\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## What the bundle does"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Each package declares a DSH bundle (`dsh.bundle.patch` → `cordis.patch.yml`),\nso `dsh plugin` instal"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ls both and applies their patches:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. the engine package inserts the `hy-sde-pi-durable` row — the `piDurableAgent`\nservice at the HOST"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" plane. It **injects nothing** from the host: pi-durable\nowns its storage medium, so the row sits at"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" the host plane (a durable,\nprocess-wide service), not inside a preset.\n2. the tool package inserts "},{"id":"p22s4","text":"the `hy-sde-tool-pi-durable` preset row — the six\n`durable_agent_*` tools plus the `durable-agent` p"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"rompt section. Without the\nengine service the tools still mount and every call fails loud with\n`[pi-"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"durable-unavailable]` — mounting a preset must never break session\ncreation over an optional host."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### What the durable agent is"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"A **separate conversation** the model can drive: its own transcript, its own\ncoding toolset (bash/re"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ad/write/edit via `CodingTools` + `NodeExecutionEnv`),\nits own durable SQLite storage, and its own m"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"odel route (the configured\nrelay). Submissions are exactly-once per `requestId`, every commit is\nche"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ckpointed, the process can crash and resume, and conversations fork at any\nentry (transcript inherit"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ed up to the fork point)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Layering (complementary, zero code overlap):"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **Maka / dsh-graph** — the harness orchestration plane: who promised what,\nwho needs waking (work "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"schedule, exactly-once claims, wakes).\n- **pi-durable (this plugin)** — how far one conversation got"},{"id":"p26s3","text":": per-step\ncheckpoints, fork-at-entry, durable documents/tasks.\n- **celld** (optional substrate, not"},{"id":"p26s4","text":" used here) — did the write reach durable\nproof (RPO=0) across processes."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Component | Supported contract |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Node.js | `^22.19.0 \\|\\| >=24.0.0` (`engines.node`) |\n| DeepSeek Harness | `0.2.0-rc.2` peer range"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" (`@deepseek-ai/cordis ~4.0.4`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools ^0.2.0-rc.2`) |\n| Upstream runtime | `@earen"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"dil-works/pi-durable`, `@earendil-works/pi-ai`, `@earendil-works/chord` pinned `1.4.0` (upstream v1."},{"id":"p29s4","text":"4.0, schema-v2 SQLite store) — regular npm dependencies, unmodified |\n| Storage | pi-durable owns it"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"s SQLite medium — default `~/.dsh/storages/pi-agent.sqlite`, overridable via the row's `path` |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Upstream seam-contract changes require a new package release and contract\nreview."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
